<!doctype html><html lang="vi"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#faf8f4"><title><%= streak.title %> · Streak Garden</title><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest/<%= streak.id %>.webmanifest"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/icon-192.png"><link rel="icon" href="/icons/flame.svg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/widget.js" defer></script></head><body class="standalone" data-id="<%= streak.id %>"><main class="standalone-content"><a class="eyebrow" href="/">← STREAK GARDEN</a><article class="single-widget streak-card <%= streak.color %>"><span class="card-mascot"><%- include('partials/mascot', { stage: streak.days >= 100 ? 3 : streak.days >= 30 ? 2 : streak.days >= 7 ? 1 : 0 }) %></span><h1 id="single-title"><%= streak.title %></h1><div class="day-count"><strong id="single-days"><%= streak.days %></strong><span>ngày liên tiếp</span></div><p class="start-date" id="single-start">Từ <%= formatDate(streak.startDate) %></p><p>Chậm cũng được. Miễn là bạn tiếp tục.</p></article><p id="connection-status" role="status">Số ngày tự cập nhật khi trang đang mở.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/">Quản lý streak ↗</a></main></body></html>
